    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKABILLY HOSTEL is a simple walking simulator based on pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no concept of story and/or clear the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is just a game for you to walking around and look around the beautiful abandoned buildings and the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing more about this game but it is OK as long as the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >girls and the graphics are pretty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main characters can walk around seaside towns which left abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the houses, the ruins, forests, beaches and various places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/d6b0fa1d6249b8e4ad69fb81a1520294.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are pretty girls live in some abandoned buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no heart warming communication or any episode like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the natural communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/9735ffcec9f02552d0da2988cfc0af9b.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/210994ca0bc080f670db7341e9fc97c3.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the &quot;PHOTO &quot;button to show the pretty pictures on your display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you go to a special place, the button turns yellow and you can see more special pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/82273d3cae83fa56c9a2c9f9a8088bc0.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find the stamps when you explore the abandoned buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of the stamps to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you complete the collection, nothing will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/1d104e2dfa06bbf1be85327a46b83b1e.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKABILLY HOSTEL is a simple walking simulator based on pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no concept of story and/or clear the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is just a game for you to walking around and look around the beautiful abandoned buildings and the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing more about this game but it is OK as long as the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >girls and the graphics are pretty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main characters can walk around seaside towns which left abandoned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the houses, the ruins, forests, beaches and various places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/d6b0fa1d6249b8e4ad69fb81a1520294.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are pretty girls live in some abandoned buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no heart warming communication or any episode like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the natural communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/9735ffcec9f02552d0da2988cfc0af9b.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/210994ca0bc080f670db7341e9fc97c3.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the &quot;PHOTO &quot;button to show the pretty pictures on your display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you go to a special place, the button turns yellow and you can see more special pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/82273d3cae83fa56c9a2c9f9a8088bc0.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may find the stamps when you explore the abandoned buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of the stamps to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you complete the collection, nothing will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586850/extras/1d104e2dfa06bbf1be85327a46b83b1e.avif?t=1746194914\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p>",
